{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"Making her way onto *The Strix*, Secel tossed the redcoat hat onto her bed. Then, undressing, she threw on her sleeping gown and sat down to write a letter she has been meaning to write for a while now.","created_at":"2021-08-01T22:35:24.191000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"871521527282143252","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"To: Reverend Hagan\nFrom: Secel\n\n  Reverend Hagan, \n      ||A thousand apologies for not sending this letter sooner, but things have become complicated. The war has finally enveloped Empire City. Blood has been shed for a little while now, and I don’t know how long until I join in the bloodshed. Other then that, I have been doing well, and I hope you are likewise well. I’ll make sure to write more often.||\n                         ~ Secel","created_at":"2021-08-01T23:18:18.982000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-02T00:14:31.813000Z","id":"871532326738333796","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"*Then, she grabbed a second piece of paper and began writing.*","created_at":"2021-08-01T23:19:18.087000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"871532574642679878","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"To: Adeia and Midas\nFrom: Secel\n\n||The second page is for my parents only.||\nDear Mother & Father,\n   ||I hope you two are well. I’ve been through a lot. The Voice is back, and I feel the Fiend in me clawing her way to the surface. But, almost as if Athena foresaw this and put out paths to cross, I met someone. His name is Johnathan, and I know you both will approve of him. If everything works out, I hope you can make it to our wedding if we get that far. I love and miss you both, and I’ll be sure  to write more frequently.||\n\n||PS: Athena told me how proud you both are of me. I wish you were here to see me coming out of that shell I had growing up.||\n                    ~ Love forever, your daughter Secel","created_at":"2021-08-01T23:23:01.616000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"871533512191270983","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"Eventually Secel makes her way back inside *The Strix*. Hanging up the cloak, she climbs into bed and falls asleep.","created_at":"2021-08-02T07:46:30.629000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"871660217975308299","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
