{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"a letter arrives for secel bearing the symbol of the church:\n📩 || Secel,\nwe regret to inform you in the time of your letters travel reverend hagan was sent to the front lines and hasn't returned. We know that you and he had been close and we have decided to let you know that he has likely fallen. you are requested to say your sacraments to the fallen before Athena to honor his sacrifice, he knew the risks and that it was necessary for us to win and restore order. we also ask you pray for our victory as it will echo into this new world you are scouting for us that our order may extend there as well. we here pray for your fiendish condition and affliction.\n\nblessed be,\nbishop kategoros||","created_at":"2021-08-06T20:39:06.578000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-06T20:40:17.612000Z","id":"873304200380039228","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"As Secel finishes reading the letter, she sets it down and pulls her legs up to bury her face in something. All she felt she could do at the moment was cry. All she wanted Johnathan, her parents, anyone she cares about. But that was impossible. She then began crying, keeping it as silent as possible. \n\nGrabbing hold of her necklace, she whispered: \"Athena... I know I'm probably the last one you want to hear from given what happened the prior night... and the last two months... but, I...\" She takes a breath, trying hard not to start crying. \"I ask for you to protect Hagan if he still lives, to protect the sisters and brothers in arms with him, and to guide us via your warrior's wisdom.\" She pauses. \"I... also ask that...\" She trails off. \"No. I'll tell him when I see him. But... please forgive me for all I've done, and all I will undoubtedly do....\" A small sigh escapes her lips. \"If you can't, I understand.\"\n\nShe then stands up and makes her way outside to take a breath of fresh air.","created_at":"2021-08-07T07:11:04.252000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873463238631768134","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"Walking out onto the bow of *The Strix*, Secel pulls the cloak a little tighter around her. She leans against the edge, sinking slightly against it as she looks out into the night sky. Something had always brought her calm at night. Maybe it's her connection to Athena and, by extent, owls. Maybe it's the beauty of the sky filled with stars. \n\nMentally shrugging as she rests her head on her arm, she watches the sky for any owls flying at night. *\"You'd best be on the lookout for owls,\"* the voice of her father ran through her head, *\"because they are not only a symbol of Athena, but a sign. They are bringers of wisdom and knowledge that you should listen to and learn from.\"* \"But what if they don't want to tell?\" she mumbles, her eyes batting a little. *\"Then they won't. But if they do, listen and learn from their teachings.\"* \n\nShe rolls her head to the other side, a small sigh escaping her lips. \"I am here if you wish to grand me knowledge.\" She says, touching the necklace. \"Assuming you still have me as a follower.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T05:53:17.151000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875617990584967190","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
